Whenever you acquire a Kingdom Card, place a Faction Marker on a Council that matches that card's Suit (max of 2 per Council). Each marker gives you {{b}}+1{{/b}}[VOTES] in its Council.

Abilities that remove cards from a Council can also remove your markers from Councils.

{{b}}THE PINNACLE{{/b}}
Pay {{b}}1{{/b}}[INFLUENCE] to the Reserve. Move all three Boons here to your Supply. You {{b}}must{{/b}} discard two Boons from your Supply.

{{b}}THE LABYRINTH{{/b}}
Look at both Boons here. Move one Boon to your Supply and give one to an opponent.

{{b}}THE ENTRANCE{{/b}}
Move the Boon here to your Supply.

